<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.87.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.87.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 1.4 trillion yen worth of three-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Lowest price	99.87  Stop rate     0.522 pct</p>
<p>Average price     99.871 Average yield 0.517 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   4.20891  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.39969  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 37.8846 pct Issue date July 22, 1997 Maturity date Oct 20, 1997</p>
</text>
